{"id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ctl-star-syntax.md","title":"CTL* 的双类有限语法树","display":"df-ctl-star-syntax — CTL* 的双类有限语法树","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","aliases":["29-df-ctl-star-syntax"],"display":"df-ctl-star-syntax — CTL* 的双类有限语法树","depends_on":[],"source_locator":"Definition14.27 and derived operators, pp.235–236, scans250–251","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层；扫描251原图核对；显式加入状态布尔闭包及类型标签"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ctl-star-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ctl-star-syntax — CTL* 的双类有限语法树"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition14.27 and derived operators, pp.235–236, scans250–251"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层；扫描251原图核对；显式加入状态布尔闭包及类型标签"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0,\\ldots,p_{k-1}\">\\(p_0,\\ldots,p_{k-1}\\)</span> 为互不相同的原子命题名。以下构造子作用于有限语法树，彼此不相同；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,p\">\\(s,p\\)</span> 区分状态和路径构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 把状态树嵌入路径树。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_{k,j},\\mathsf P_{k,j}\">\\(\\mathsf S_{k,j},\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\)</span> 是下式同时递归构造的有限深度树集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_k\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf A,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf G,\\mathsf{EX},\\mathsf{EF},\\mathsf{EG}\">\\(\\mathsf A,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf G,\\mathsf{EX},\\mathsf{EF},\\mathsf{EG}\\)</span> 均为下式给出的派生语法缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\top_s,\\bot_s,p_0,\\ldots,p_{k-1}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf P_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\top_s,\\bot_s,p_0,\\ldots,p_{k-1}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf P_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\neg_s a,\\land_s(a,b)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf E\\phi\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\neg_s a,\\land_s(a,b)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf E\\phi\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\iota a\\mid a\\in\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\}\\cup\\{\\neg_p\\phi,\\land_p(\\phi,\\psi),\\mathsf X\\phi,\\mathsf U(\\phi,\\psi)\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf P_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\iota a\\mid a\\in\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\}\\cup\\{\\neg_p\\phi,\\land_p(\\phi,\\psi),\\mathsf X\\phi,\\mathsf U(\\phi,\\psi)\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf S_{k,j},\\qquad\\mathsf P_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf P_{k,j}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf S_{k,j},\\qquad\\mathsf P_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf P_{k,j}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf A\\phi\\coloneqq\\neg_s\\mathsf E(\\neg_p\\phi),\\quad\\mathsf F\\phi\\coloneqq\\mathsf U(\\iota\\top_s,\\phi),\\quad\\mathsf G\\phi\\coloneqq\\neg_p\\mathsf F(\\neg_p\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf A\\phi\\coloneqq\\neg_s\\mathsf E(\\neg_p\\phi),\\quad\\mathsf F\\phi\\coloneqq\\mathsf U(\\iota\\top_s,\\phi),\\quad\\mathsf G\\phi\\coloneqq\\neg_p\\mathsf F(\\neg_p\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EX}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf X(\\iota a),\\quad\\mathsf{EF}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf F(\\iota a),\\quad\\mathsf{EG}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf G(\\iota a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EX}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf X(\\iota a),\\quad\\mathsf{EF}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf F(\\iota a),\\quad\\mathsf{EG}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf G(\\iota a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition14.27，印刷235–236页、扫描250–251；原书后续翻译和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\phi=\\neg E\\neg\\phi\">\\(A\\phi=\\neg E\\neg\\phi\\)</span> 已使用状态布尔闭包，这里将其显式补全。树标签避免把“状态公式也可作为路径公式”误解为两个递归求值函数的域重叠。集合递增；每个元素是有限树，因此相互递归仍以严格子树为良基。此原子只给语法，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 当作未定义的对象量词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p_0,\\ldots,p_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"s,p","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_{k,j},\\mathsf P_{k,j}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf A,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf G,\\mathsf{EX},\\mathsf{EF},\\mathsf{EG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\{\\top_s,\\bot_s,p_0,\\ldots,p_{k-1}\\},\\qquad\\mathsf P_{k,0}\\coloneqq\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\neg_s a,\\land_s(a,b)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf E\\phi\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf P_{k,j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\cup\\{\\iota a\\mid a\\in\\mathsf S_{k,j}\\}\\cup\\{\\neg_p\\phi,\\land_p(\\phi,\\psi),\\mathsf X\\phi,\\mathsf U(\\phi,\\psi)\\mid\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf P_{k,j}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf S_{k,j},\\qquad\\mathsf P_k\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf P_{k,j}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf A\\phi\\coloneqq\\neg_s\\mathsf E(\\neg_p\\phi),\\quad\\mathsf F\\phi\\coloneqq\\mathsf U(\\iota\\top_s,\\phi),\\quad\\mathsf G\\phi\\coloneqq\\neg_p\\mathsf F(\\neg_p\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{EX}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf X(\\iota a),\\quad\\mathsf{EF}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf F(\\iota a),\\quad\\mathsf{EG}a\\coloneqq\\mathsf E\\mathsf G(\\iota a).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\phi=\\neg E\\neg\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":2371,"backlinks":[{"id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k,\\iota,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf X,\\mathsf U$ 及带下标的布尔构造子见 [[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]。"},{"id":"bd34a489475a6b08","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"状态及路径语法集合 $\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k$、嵌入 $\\iota$ 和构造子见 [[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]；$s\\in S$，$\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)$。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]、[[29-thm-ctl-basic-tc]] — 有限转移系统、CTL* 与基本可达性刻画"},{"id":"ec51b0bd93fa3fdf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cef4708b7fffcfcb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]"}],"outgoing":[]}